{"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"constraintViolation()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which ends once the tracker has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"finished and every report has been read. A ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference"},{"text":" tracker’s is empty.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"One task reads the reports at a time. The first iterator to read holds them until its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iteration ends or it is released; a second reader meanwhile waits its turn, logging a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warning once, then reads on from the next report, so the first gets every report in order.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A reader cancelled while it waits returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReports11AsyncQueues0E5QueueVyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"remoteSource":{"fileName":"Tracker.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L364"},"title":"rejectionReports","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","text":"Records","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"topic","title":"records","abstract":[{"text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","role":"symbol"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncQueue","preciseIdentifier":"s:11AsyncQueues0A5QueueV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","type":"topic","title":"rejectionReports"},"doc://AsyncQueues/documentation/AsyncQueues/AsyncQueue":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"AsyncQueue","url":"\/documentation\/asyncqueues\/asyncqueue","identifier":"doc:\/\/AsyncQueues\/documentation\/AsyncQueues\/AsyncQueue","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"AsyncQueue"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Elements in the order they are enqueued, kept until they are read; one reader at a time reads"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them."}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"type":"topic","title":"Tracker","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop","fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noOp","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind"